{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0283","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000000fc:text","row":38426,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「途中までは一緒だな」","en":"“We can walk together partway.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903160","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00001","en":"Taichi: \"We're together part of the way.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000001b0:text","row":38427,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903161","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00002","en":"Miki: \"Yes.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000001d0:text","row":38428,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"歩く。","en":"We walked.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903162","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00003","en":"Walking.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000002d1:text","row":38429,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"途中、美希が手を繋いできた。","en":"Along the way, Miki took my hand.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903163","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00004","en":"On the way, Miki linked hands.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000030d:text","row":38430,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ん？」","en":"“...Hmm?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903164","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00005","en":"Taichi: \"...hm?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000003b7:text","row":38431,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「お借りします！」","en":"“Let me borrow this!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903165","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00006","en":"Miki: \"I'll be borrowing this!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000003e9:text","row":38432,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「うむ」","en":"“Indeed.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903166","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00007","en":"Taichi: \"Indeed.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000409:text","row":38433,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"神妙な。","en":"So solemn.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903167","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00008","en":"So meek.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000429:text","row":38434,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"美希の手は小さく、細かった。","en":"Miki's hand was small and slender.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903168","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00009","en":"Miki's hand was so tiny and so slender.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000045d:text","row":38435,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"こんな手で、八人だけの世界の調停役として、生き延びてきたのだ。","en":"With hands like these, she had survived as mediator in a world of only eight people.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903169","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00010","en":"It's with these hands that she has acted as arbitrator in this world of only eight people, and lived on.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000004b3:text","row":38436,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"走る俺にキックを入れたタイミングもそうだが。","en":"The timing of the kick she landed on me while I was running, for one.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903170","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00011","en":"The timing with which she kicked me as I ran, of course,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000004f7:text","row":38437,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"屋上で霧を助けた時の動き。","en":"And the way she moved when she saved Kiri on the rooftop.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903171","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00012","en":"but also in her movements when she rescued Miki on the rooftop.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["name_address","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese says Miki rescued Kiri on the rooftop. The English replaces the rescued person with Miki herself.","remedy":"when she rescued Kiri on the rooftop","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":62,"start":26,"text":"when she rescued Miki on the rooftop"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000529:text","row":38438,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"あれはただごとではなかった。","en":"That had been extraordinary.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903172","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00013","en":"Those were not trivial things.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000055d:text","row":38439,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"刹那の硬直を弾いて動く者。","en":"Someone who could shake off a split-second freeze and move.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903173","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00014","en":"She's someone who leaps off of the rigidification of the moment and into the act.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000058f:text","row":38440,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"ここに凡と非凡の差がある。","en":"That was where the difference between ordinary and exceptional lay.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903174","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00015","en":"That is the difference between the mediocre and the prodigious.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000005c1:text","row":38441,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"生きぬいて、自らをそこまで鍛えた美希。","en":"Miki had survived and trained herself to that level.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903175","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00016","en":"That's the extent to which Miki has disciplined herself to survive until the last.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000005ff:text","row":38442,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"感心の一語に尽きる。","en":"There was only one word for it: impressive.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903176","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00017","en":"It all comes down to one word: admiration.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000078f:text","row":38443,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃ、ここでお別れだな」","en":"“Well, this is where we part.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903177","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00018","en":"Taichi: \"So, here we have our parting.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000082a:text","row":38444,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“…………”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903178","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00019","en":"Miki: \"......\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000084e:text","row":38445,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"手を離さない。","en":"She didn't let go of my hand.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903179","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00020","en":"She does not release the hand.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000087c:text","row":38446,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「美希？」","en":"“Miki?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903180","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00021","en":"Taichi: \"Miki?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000008c3:text","row":38447,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、あのー、えーと」","en":"“Uh, um, well...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903181","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00022","en":"Miki: \"Ah, uhmmm, welll.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000008f9:text","row":38448,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「まだ話したりない？」","en":"“Do you still want to talk?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903182","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00023","en":"Taichi: \"Still want to talk some more or something?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000009ad:text","row":38449,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい、実は……」","en":"“Yes. Actually...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903183","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00024","en":"Miki: \"Yes, the truth is...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000009df:text","row":38450,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「実は？」","en":"“Actually?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903184","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00025","en":"Taichi: \"The truth is?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000a87:text","row":38451,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「ええと、そのー、あー、確か……」","en":"“Umm, well, ah...let's see...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903185","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00026","en":"Miki: \"Welll, it's, ah, really...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000ac1:text","row":38452,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"停滞。","en":"Deadlock.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903186","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00027","en":"Stagnation.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000adf:text","row":38453,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"助け船を出す。","en":"I threw her a lifeline.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903187","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00028","en":"I launch a lifeboat.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","word_choice"],"assessment":"The idiom means that he throws her a conversational lifeline or comes to her aid. The English renders a literal nautical action.","remedy":"I throw her a lifeline.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":20,"start":0,"text":"I launch a lifeboat."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000b0d:text","row":38454,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「そういえば」","en":"“Come to think of it.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903188","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00029","en":"Taichi: \"Come to think of it,\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000bb9:text","row":38455,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「はいっ」","en":"“Yes!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903189","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00030","en":"Miki: \"Yes?!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000bdb:text","row":38456,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"顔が輝く。","en":"Her face lit up.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903190","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00031","en":"Her face lights up.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000bfd:text","row":38457,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"強くなっても無邪気だった。","en":"She had grown strong without losing her innocence.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903191","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00032","en":"She became strong, but still she was innocent.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000c37:text","row":38458,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「屋上で霧を助けたろ？」","en":"“You saved Kiri on the rooftop, right?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903192","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00033","en":"Taichi: \"You saved Kiri on the rooftop, right?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000ced:text","row":38459,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「ええ」","en":"“Yes.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903193","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00034","en":"Miki: \"Yah.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000d15:text","row":38460,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺は目だけはいいからわかるんだけどね」","en":"“I've got good eyes, if nothing else, so I could tell.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903194","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00035","en":"Taichi: \"All that's good of me are my eyes, so I understood this.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation"],"assessment":"He says his eyesight or powers of observation are good, not that his eyes are the only good thing about him.","remedy":"I've got good eyes, so I could tell.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":42,"start":9,"text":"All that's good of me are my eyes"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000ddb:text","row":38461,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「……はあ？」","en":"“...Huh?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903195","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00036","en":"Miki: \"...huh?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000e09:text","row":38462,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「あれは打算する者の動きではなかった」","en":"“That wasn't how someone calculating her own advantage would move.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903196","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00037","en":"Taichi: \"Those where not the motions of a calculating self-interested person.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography","grammar"],"assessment":"The line uses the adverb 'where' in place of the past-tense verb 'were.'","remedy":"Those were not","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":24,"start":9,"text":"Those where not"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000ea8:text","row":38463,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"瞳が見開く。","en":"Her eyes opened wide.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903197","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00038","en":"Her eyes open wide.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000ed4:text","row":38464,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「とだけ言っておこう」","en":"“That's all I'll say.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903198","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00039","en":"Taichi: \"I'll just leave it with that said.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000f0a:text","row":38465,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「……………………」","en":"“……………………”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903199","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00040","en":"Miki: \"............\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000f36:text","row":38466,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"天啓に打たれたように、立ち尽くす。","en":"She stood rooted, as if struck by revelation.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903200","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00041","en":"She stood stock still as if she was struck by divine revelation.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000f78:text","row":38467,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「……今の美希のまま、生きろよ。せっかくそこまで今の自分を保ったんだ」","en":"“...Live on as the Miki you are now. You went to all this trouble to preserve your present self.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903201","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00042","en":"Taichi: \"...live on, Miki, as you are now. You've gone to great lengths to protect yourself as you are after all.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00000fde:text","row":38468,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「ずっと先を生きる別の俺を、すっげー大人のいい女になった美希がおちょくるなんて、楽しそうだ」","en":"“It sounds like fun—some different me way off in the future getting teased by a Miki who's grown into one hell of a woman.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903202","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00043","en":"Taichi: \"I'm so looking forwards to you teasing a different me that lives waaay on ahead, Miki, as you become an aaawesome adult and an amazing woman.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000010d8:text","row":38469,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「……え、ええ……わたし、すっげーいい女になりますから……」","en":"“...Y-yes... I'll grow into one hell of a woman...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903203","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00044","en":"Miki: \"...eh, yes... because I'll become an aaawesome amazing woman...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000112c:text","row":38470,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"掠れた声。","en":"Her voice was hoarse.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903204","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00045","en":"Her voice had become husky.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00001156:text","row":38471,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「よし、そんなとこだ」","en":"“Good. That settles it.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903205","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00046","en":"Taichi: \"Good, just like that.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000118c:text","row":38472,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「あとこれ、日記。しっかり祠におさめておいてくれよ」","en":"“And this—my diary. Make sure you put it away safely in the shrine.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903206","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00047","en":"Taichi: \"And then, here, the diary. Be sure to offer it to the inside of that hokora.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["word_choice","grammar"],"assessment":"He asks her to store or place the diary securely in the shrine. The English's 'offer it to the inside' changes the action into a malformed ritual offering.","remedy":"make sure you put it safely inside the shrine","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":84,"start":47,"text":"offer it to the inside of that hokora"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000011d8:text","row":38473,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"受けとる手が弱々しい。","en":"Her hand was weak as she took it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903207","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00048","en":"A slender, frail, feminine hands receives it.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","addition"],"assessment":"The Japanese says the hand receiving it is weak or unsteady. The English has number disagreement and adds unsupported physical descriptors.","remedy":"The hand that takes it looks weak.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":45,"start":0,"text":"A slender, frail, feminine hands receives it."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000128c:text","row":38474,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………はい」","en":"“…………Yes.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903208","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00049","en":"Miki: \"......yes.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000136c:text","row":38475,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"身をかがめて、最後のキス。","en":"I bent down for one last kiss.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903209","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00050","en":"I bend over, and one last kiss.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000139e:text","row":38476,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"すぐ離れる。","en":"I drew away at once.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903210","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00051","en":"Quickly distancing.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000142b:text","row":38477,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“……”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903211","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00052","en":"Miki: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00001453:text","row":38478,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「ではでは、また来週」","en":"“Well then, see you next week.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903212","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00053","en":"Taichi: \"Then well then, see you next week!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00001481:text","row":38479,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"この挨拶は気に入った。","en":"I liked that greeting.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903213","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00054","en":"That farewell I found suitable.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["word_choice"],"assessment":"The narrator says he liked the farewell, not merely that he judged it suitable.","remedy":"I liked that farewell.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":30,"start":16,"text":"found suitable"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000014af:text","row":38480,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"クールに決めるぞ。","en":"Time to play it cool.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903214","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00055","en":"I decided, I'm gonna be cool.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00001591:text","row":38481,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"折り目正しく踵を返す。","en":"I turned crisply on my heel.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903215","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00056","en":"With good manners I turn on my heels,","verdict":"questionable","categories":["idiom_calque","register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000015bf:text","row":38482,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"紳士的に歩いていく。","en":"I walked away like a gentleman.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903216","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00057","en":"and gentlemanly set on walking.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00001610:text","row":38483,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"「……先輩！」","en":"“...Taichi!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903217","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00058","en":"Miki: \"...Senpai!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00001636:text","row":38484,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"止まる。","en":"I stopped.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903218","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00059","en":"Stop.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000016dc:text","row":38485,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"「今週もー！　お世話に！　なりましたっ！」","en":"“Thank you! For everything! This week too!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903219","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00060","en":"Miki: \"Thank you again! For all you have done! This week tooo!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000171e:text","row":38486,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"応援団風の挨拶に、口元がゆるむ。","en":"That cheer-squad-style sendoff made me smile.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903220","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00061","en":"A farewell shouted like she were in a cheer squad, that makes my lips curl into a smile.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000175e:text","row":38487,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"「……おう」","en":"“...Yeah.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903221","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00062","en":"Taichi: \"...right.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00001808:text","row":38488,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"「また、来週！」","en":"“See you next week!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903222","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00063","en":"Miki: \"See you! Next week!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00001830:text","row":38489,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"手をぶんぶん振る。","en":"She waved her hand vigorously.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903223","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00064","en":"Hands shaking swiftly.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000185a:text","row":38490,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"そうそう。","en":"Yes, exactly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903224","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00065","en":"Yeppy yep.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:0000187c:text","row":38491,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"一人で生きようとする者は、気張ってな。","en":"“If you're going to live alone, stay strong.”","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903225","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00066","en":"People who intend to live alone really gotta go all out.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000018ba:text","row":38492,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"自分を大切にするのは、時としてつらい道だけど。","en":"Caring for yourself can sometimes be a hard road.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903226","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00067","en":"But the way of holding oneself so precious is, at times, painful.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00001900:text","row":38493,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"極論ではあるが。","en":"That was taking it to an extreme, but—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903227","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00068","en":"It's something of an extreme argument, but,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00001928:text","row":38494,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"自己犠牲は、ひるがえせば全て自分のための行いとも言えるのだから。","en":"one could also say that self-sacrifice, turned around, is something we do entirely for ourselves.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903228","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00069","en":"it's because if one tries to take their self-sacrifices back, they'll all become acts that can be said to have been merely performed for the sake of the self.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese says that, viewed from the reverse side, every act of self-sacrifice can be considered an act for oneself. It does not describe retracting prior sacrifices.","remedy":"looked at another way, every act of self-sacrifice can be called an act for oneself","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":60,"start":13,"text":"if one tries to take their self-sacrifices back"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:00001980:text","row":38495,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"美希はメチャ正しい。","en":"Miki was absolutely right.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903229","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00070","en":"Miki is unreasonably correct.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000019b4:text","row":38496,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"「おーう」","en":"“Yeeah.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903230","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00071","en":"Taichi: \"Oooh-huh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0283:000019d6:text","row":38497,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"こうして、俺たちは別れた。","en":"And so we parted.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903231","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4024:00072","en":"And that was how we parted.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
